#: ee5f1ce99bad4c308bdfd8a977ae6d59
msgid "When you compile Copter (in **~/ardupilot/ArduCopter**) the executable **ArduCopter.elf** is created in the same folder. You need to move the executable to home (\\`~/\\`or \\`/home/erle/\\`) because there is a service in Erle-Brain 2 (called **apm.service**) which automatically launches the autopilot from those locations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/building-for-erle-brain-2.rst:80
